    <Placemark>
      <name>弁財天</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4stY5zkIGmyfIGeiB-ivAO6nNjVOfQI0KAfjKysa0RYcgr8U4-3U3R2Ifjlpgw1Vu3mOlQJyvzEEYWoxcOBmjEyOE4HOQy7-W1sBjK8Ofr6drQd8WO3uxkL2B7UPhTBuWZR8wBGrl1OK7HmMieN87glnyK5F4xZBl4ZbyoelOS1OrLhF6fv_meva3QzbuZylRXk2E8zk0_ZPNbnNyuJcnEK2tX_qyaN7bL2ngirNai5VokO8epX0Y9ANRPBBeEpiRB3bCWRPUkC7x2oofP8Rq5yv2ECwK8ZhbnxqeG6NzTErMKoasFsqOpWzNQEquOBqGI_MmcLLPzeeiNcO7m2JS2Imu4KiQgwxS_dCxdNJrf2UGG3HWlgBUwZmqpnEdQQlAzoDWfbuNaUXjQCb3wlACk6GHwbSH53zltNa_dnFxyXj2TOa4FY4sesKSYcUALB_T52aSQglHaAClj0OZwaTDxHrdcK8CsrsVVOKkNWjpLou88XEiR5CNdAlCF1Ozpirv7G01legi4hO6MCWTemVEUjuoUVZwPl--9mv8OvXREYekmVJc9EjIV_tlmoZFFGQCqM2OFeGj7-ZricLJOIaR1a2Mu6Me-fwM4rrcj8Ew5fDpvLR8otQOK1xcCtG_DgRsJerU441O-J2IK2BbxfYjAlo9X56zWxbWxcqoqZhwTcR6AuKq8tfK6QeOq6bqNgEQ-lyk47vTrtDrWdpyMsUinYZLerQ" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>「火防稲荷より東に50m、3体とも弁財天」<br><br>「　弁才天　荒川（右岸）<br>　埼玉県大里郡大里町津田<br>　稲荷社の東50m、参道脇に<br>　祀られている。<br>　３体とも弁財天だと思われる。<br>　手前の弁才天女の台座には<br>　ソと思われる種子。(水辺の神様その8)」]]></description>
