    <Placemark>
      <name>水神碑</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4fnDzBhKIf9TYT8_cUYwh3MEDBaEg76GoOBHP--xVrJMh4bWIF4lJH8U8knXsGdLjm9NS09gx9q2lyZZhy8KMyyE19FFPM3266DwfPKrp0ASpIsZhPMpZnpjibtz7-u-zO74DrfFmwPyvhROXryI6mOaAHh4JdT2jbc64bPN7MfV493dxXOTB-wrdBwpL1BOLiEmbkNI_DzHUg3YwKcOgZkAp5yK2p62Fqx95-iQpcWi9shSCUHM7hVWtwKop1sOi0I2A9PVwRemuqDjRu9V4xk9qh96OLHQKCDiI8ttf_crbvmP3jLbiymRpp78TavAc4DGLU-0eRx3k56WWVkxkCF-vbIaaiGjI_AKHbLlNS4WdcTvbkg1A0TfqWIVegtH2L4sAYKqRyetnEdV3Pa9i4AgEW5GvFRBaOpafNE3_HcOsLXhQvRbtbDbnKAv802T9X8TVvFW2_4EYeveTd7BIMmclX_vZQ1BAETpFAGooiZecM3hjLhoW_dprsmiDqu3wV3zAt1m7n82p4rojewU0lN596SAb_bZWtes01z7xTHr6Je2qVDywHJBWpwicWYdFBSdqO87ysiTVdH7vjeBmpakQ7M4R8jaFKdwUCRkRy4G9vYpag9Wf8vfjx6Vacx6KNxsYtLw9QkDgW-pHQDIjHQKglnk7bI3kP7ul2NmURporodFasSTT7BnsaRIUQ32tFBxHpmFVHJlaJVFiTdWz13F71" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>https://www.city.edogawa.tokyo.jp/e016/sports/kankomidokoro/edogawa100/edogawarashisa/rekishi/127suijinhi.html<br><br>明治十一年献身的な努力によって善兵衛樋を完成させた石井善兵衛の偉功　　　大正十五年に建立された偉功碑である<br>310cmx110cmx18cm、台石の高さ36cm<br>詳細は江戸川区史第3巻pp.591-592、金石文も明記]]></description>
