      <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v5eOy4ehCLqC2Dyyy9K5IhQ73oAS8ZWDeN0oAxw5H-kVN0Zwq0DDokDK3QgOrsKljjYotzuakvTflPVXgleojVRoxYnRfQdWbllJpEMqg1HuDsvNH7RBcsZWyE4W_n8m9_jHnoXeIbvUVBw4ITBDg1Xd6krLbElHKman5xHyPGaqVRyqNFhiwoGRrqM8Utjw9RKFhZon_CbnAncorOoH1ctYAbw-ghuSPxs8dyjk2iOiKR6eoQdo-IukHUVmVG4tGFP4CI4ELNJxAWZCcjj4qDpnX7QSoYgpTjsPWUHbooDu_uPkoC0KF6sReL3YOjFwJeWpKYS19hvej6XhNJDVkoKaQFGBUFfDphjXiyfoIS3yLqE9uUNGd3FdlNf66BWDB9AL0Hb6K3wRADPwkYm_OT86tYoxOwXqKXVrMv2cnHyOQWdZ7s09YKZdiQy9s0UTTo-hk5cnhOHVxkfiaigwTnaXHFZvidrg63S2m3pgrKDdPV8wNqisbAhL3m1Kb3dX0cnscfU_-cZlen8PZLKCDDtMPDS4xIh42sPIPixuwAfMj9657sT0qFQySqF66saw0qK7I3vdOIrkXe91v09ZF82w41lgvdw7MY_XLcy7069upEWEAAhMkCDKxsNsVqwRIxBJtwJXY1xkR_Ed6LKejIzudyg-X9Krb5M7NF-ZJaf2IT0X2xGg5ugSDf4_l0YZ1Xtxi3dCfTaGRloGAuLCKP6H8e4yA" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>掲示の由緒によると「水神宮」「船玉神」「金刀比羅神」の三柱を合祀しています。鳥居には、青海波文様が施されています<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v61duPSvb_FjYdcyLAT1YYBZdt0Y2FRzF7Tc3wZ93jFH6njSRMK_nGvGQl-Xdhk0SPkh-En5UHISvoFgGfydWZNWMmNdwmUXKTWET4YO0NoEfLcM-oXvZ6oPwDcjVBH6GGo9KXNxzahayfnzScxm6oTzsA43wvnTIJbQ-ZT4GSUDtVlSdjl8EhKt87a8gu3kIjasi6prdojMulegkGeR0c5Cs6JnTRcBVtzJwZPQrgk-tkbtz1l2sNTaDai85cEfxixQScbddWNq6N-cRdXgqLtQ2jNrLDzcCGHB1FhSx5jw6EUNF9uj9YhFRxKC-EEzXSRQ5p5we1ZZgnBGfB9s8aCIgDOE_awGidoSqNkVLWcpw2FL4V3xJDb4GgALlTGsb6mKZZ2gX3Ep-n56HZw3isEeDcnEvGzLJHFgj0mEDyiWE9ioyqEP8MBKSr53v1HucJrw7axmFrBNUgydEI-_ES-fa6PPud4FlBX4QOcpeFsC-ykEeC3ze6M6-PSvsut1nmnrhwvNAmj6aagAiOId9DTzAvTJlTrUTwPrPSTn5SOBaqVn6TH5h6b4QAUPZxbLrHRirETu7rTQ-czBUgCKsK91OSS0OGfR2yPav38PIQb9sXwQlZlMf0pSmtxyYCWuyhIEkbg4wtL_npl8eFq5dBgWG-R-BikwCcOyz-3JJfJ5AllN-ywVwU4yj33zp08TgYjXynKPU-3jWA-mmEodvfeY39r" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
